; The variable: ssr_enabled. A smooth metal floor under a colour background reflects nothing but
; the red box above it, so the box's reflection shows only through the screen-space trace. No
; other golden enables SSR: with it off this floor stays black. The smooth green glass on the left
; draws in the alpha pass, which reads no reflection of its own. The clear lens on the right refracts
; the frame after the opaque pass, so the floor's reflection shows through it.
